# Use JRebirth processor modules

Use for generated `*ModuleStarter`, startup preloading, JPMS provider, component registration

## Read first

- `processor/.../ComponentProcessor.java`
- `core/.../module/AbstractModuleStarter.java`
- `core/.../application/AbstractApplication.java`
- `api/.../module/*.java`
- generated starters under `target/generated-sources/annotations`
- module-info examples with `provides org.jrebirth.af.api.module.ModuleStarter`

## Processor contract

`@Preload` -> `preloadClass(Target.class)`
`@BootComponent` -> `bootComponent(Target.class)`
`@RegistrationPoint(exclusive, reverse)` -> `define(Contract.class, exclusive, reverse)`
`@Register(value = Contract.class, priority = ..., weight = ...)` -> `register(Contract.class, Impl.class, priority, weight)`

If any exist processor generates `<CapitalizedArtifactId>ModuleStarter`, SPI file `META-INF/services/org.jrebirth.af.api.module.ModuleStarter`, `start()`.

Override name:

```properties
moduleStarterClass=com.acme.feature.FeatureModuleStarter
```

## JPMS provider

Named module must declare generated provider:

```java
open module com.acme.feature {
    requires org.jrebirth.af.api;
    requires org.jrebirth.af.core;
    provides org.jrebirth.af.api.module.ModuleStarter with com.acme.feature.FeatureModuleStarter;
}
```

Core has `uses ModuleStarter`; startup `preloadModules()` ServiceLoader loads starters sorts by class name calls `start()`

If generated class unresolved confirm processor path rebuild inspect generated sources Do not hand-write first

## Component SPI registration

JRebirth internal registry not JPMS ServiceLoader:

```java
@RegistrationPoint(exclusive = true, reverse = false)
public interface TodoService extends Service {}

@Register(value = TodoService.class, priority = PriorityLevel.Normal)
public final class TodoServiceImpl extends DefaultService implements TodoService {}
```

Generates `define(...)` and `register(...)`; ComponentFactory resolves by exclusive reverse priority weight

Rules: contract gets `@RegistrationPoint`; implementation gets `@Register`; priority/weight only for competition; weight below `1000`; export/open packages as needed

## Preload boot

`@Preload` static wave/resource/builder holders. `@BootComponent` startup retrieve command service model through facade

Checks: `mvn -pl <module> compile -Dmaven.test.skip=true`, inspect generated starter, module-info provider exact FQCN, expected calls, generated SPI file
